    "title": "VCU vs. Rhode Island Basketball Game Report",
    "text": "• VCU defeated Rhode Island with a final score of 84-75.\n• VCU's record is now 12-6.\n• Rhode Island's record is now 10-8.\n• Halftime score was VCU 40, Rhode Island 30.\n• VCU's leading scorer was Hill with 19 points.\n• Rhode Island's leading scorer was Cochran and Johnson with 17 and 16 points respectively.\n• VCU made 12 of 29 three-point attempts.\n• Rhode Island made 8 of 25 three-point attempts.\n• VCU had 28 rebounds, Rhode Island had 29 rebounds.\n• VCU had 16 assists, Rhode Island had 10 assists.\n• VCU committed 22 fouls, Rhode Island committed 18 fouls.\n• Attendance was 3,712.\n• VCU individual player stats: Evans 6 points, Mitchell 6 points, Jennings 0 points, Lewis 6 points, Tracey 17 points, Belle 10 points, Hill 19 points, Nowell 14 points, Ward 6 points.\n• Rhode Island individual player stats: Crawford 4 points, Itejere 11 points, Cochran 17 points, Corey 7 points, Hinton 5 points, Johnson 16 points, Tripp 9 points, Harper 6 points, King 0 points.",
